{"id": "189155", "name": "מציאת מ\"פ נורמות וזוית בין וקטורים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "gen_rand_3_mat", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[]),rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,1,rand_with_prohib(-n,n,[])],[0,0,1]))"}, {"name": "sxneg", "params": ["x"], "body": "(numberp(x) and is(x<0)) or (not atom(x) and (op(x)=\"+\" or op(x)=\"-\" or (op(x)=\"*\" and numberp(first(args(x))) and is(first(args(x))<0))))"}, {"name": "sxp", "params": ["x"], "body": "if sxneg(x) then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)"}, {"name": "sxtmul", "params": ["e"], "body": "simplode(map(sxp, args(e)), \" \\\\cdot \")"}, {"name": "sxtsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "sxtnsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], if numberp(t) and is(t<0) then concat(\"-\",tex1(-t)) else if sxneg(t) then concat(\"+\",sxp(t)) else concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "sxtsq", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(sxp(first(args(e))), \"^2\")"}, {"name": "sxtsub", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(tex1(first(args(e))), \"-\", sxp(second(args(e))))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים הוקטורים:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u = {{CT:0}}, v = {{CT:1}} \\]</p></div><p>חשבו:</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\langle u,v \\rangle =\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\"><b>הערה:</b> פונקציית שורש נכתבת כ-<code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(x)</code>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(||u|| =\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(||v|| =\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ד׳</span></div><p>את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(cos(\\alpha)\\)</span> קוסינוס הזוית בין 2 הוקטורים, עד לדיוק של 3 ספרות אחרי הנקודה:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(cos(\\alpha) =\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans4]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">בסעיף זה יש להזין מספר <code dir=\"ltr\">±x.xxx</code></p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחשבים את המכפלה הפנימית הסטנדרטית (סעיף א׳) ואת הנורמות כשורש של סכום ריבועי הרכיבים (סעיפים ב׳ ו-ג׳). את קוסינוס הזווית מקבלים מחלוקת המכפלה הפנימית במכפלת הנורמות (סעיף ד׳).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — סעיף א׳: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\)</span></b><br>המכפלה הפנימית הסטנדרטית היא סכום המכפלות של הרכיבים המתאימים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\langle u,v\\rangle={{CT:2}}={{CT:3}}={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סעיפים ב׳ ו-ג׳: הנורמות</b><br>הנורמה היא שורש המכפלה הפנימית של הווקטור עם עצמו, כלומר שורש סכום ריבועי הרכיבים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lVert u\\rVert=\\sqrt{{{CT:5}}}=\\sqrt{{{CT:6}}}=\\sqrt{{{CT:7}}}[[if test=\"{{CT:15}}\"]]={{CT:8}}[[/if]] \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lVert v\\rVert=\\sqrt{{{CT:9}}}=\\sqrt{{{CT:10}}}=\\sqrt{{{CT:11}}}[[if test=\"{{CT:16}}\"]]={{CT:12}}[[/if]] \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — סעיף ד׳: קוסינוס הזווית</b><br>הזווית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> בין הווקטורים מוגדרת על ידי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cos\\alpha=\\dfrac{\\langle u,v\\rangle}{\\lVert u\\rVert\\,\\lVert v\\rVert}\\)</span>. מציבים את התוצאות של הסעיפים הקודמים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\cos\\alpha=\\frac{{{CT:4}}}{{{CT:8}}\\cdot {{CT:12}}}={{CT:13}} \\]</p>ובקירוב עשרוני, מעוגל ל-3 ספרות אחרי הנקודה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\cos\\alpha\\approx {{CT:14}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]][[feedback:prt4]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "transpose(col(base_mat,1)) . col(base_mat,2)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> תשובה נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "sqrt((transpose(col(base_mat,1)) . col(base_mat,1)))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> תשובה נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "sqrt((transpose(col(base_mat,2)) . col(base_mat,2)))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b> תשובה נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה לא נכונה</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt4", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "NumDecPlaces", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "float(transpose(col(base_mat,1)) . col(base_mat,2)) /(sqrt((transpose(col(base_mat,1)) . col(base_mat,1))) *sqrt((transpose(col(base_mat,2)) . col(base_mat,2))))", "testoptions": "3", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ד׳ — נכון.</b> תשובה נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt4-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ד׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובה לא נכונה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["base_mat", "sxcos", "sxcosd", "sxsfu", "sxsfv", "sxu", "sxuu", "sxuuN", "sxuuT", "sxuv", "sxuvN", "sxuvT", "sxv", "sxvv", "sxvvN", "sxvvT"], "nvariants": 50}